# My Sandbox
Welcome to the `README` of my sandbox. This page aims to provide an overview of the projects under [/sandbox/corine/](). My research focuses on the atomisation of liquid fuels for combustion in the energy and aviation sectors. One of the main objectives is research into sustainable aviation fuels. The first area of focus is the atomisation of liquids using the Basilisk volume-of-fluid method in conjunction with Lagrangian particle tracking of the stable droplets formed. This method is applied to the jet in a crossflow configuration, and the results are published there: [A coupled Volume-of-Fluid and Lagrangian Point-Particle approach for investigating the plain liquid jet in crossflow atomization.](https://doi.org/10.1016/j.compfluid.2026.107230)

-*Corine Kieffer-Roth*- 

## Atomisation 
#### Lagrangian method

* [Jet in crossflow atomisation with a coupled Volume-of-Fluid and Lagrangian Point-Particle approach](jetincrossflow_VOFlagrange.c)


